paper, 60 g/m² (recycled), or newsprint, 54 g/m² (recycled)\n\n(Reverse)\n\nThis report is processed as follows.\n\n<table>\n<tr><th>Reporting party</th><th>Processing authority: Head of the tax office having jurisdiction over the place of business</th></tr>\n<tr><td>1. Prepare report</td><td>2. Receive report (Civil Service Office)</td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td>3. Investigate and verify (Department in charge)</td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td>4. Decide (Final decision delegated to the department head)</td></tr>\n</table>\n\nThe report proceeds from box 1 to box 2 on the right, then downward through boxes 3 and 4.\n","metadata":{"author_method":"Exact held-source units translated or completed using explicitly recorded source/target spans; original official records remain unchanged. All new units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION and UNREVIEWED.","author_source_review_evidence":[{"evidence":{"exact_author_input":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1526_KR000623\\translations\\author_inputs\\389efdda511138000ae8757dda9aa35320a03de9399e08064ec50cebd75f3b7c.ascii.json","sha256":"389efdda511138000ae8757dda9aa35320a03de9399e08064ec50cebd75f3b7c"},"protocol":"WORKC_P04_1526_EXPLICIT_SOURCE_REVIEWED_AUTHOR_INPUT_V1","reviewed_source_units":[{"source_component_text_sha256":"2fb7bd6f40dafc97c3fe591fd13656f131f2d10c77acbae7b6b54b31cab2dfd8","unit_key":"form-001200F"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"9486d42e7f358af6c08656eb99055e7f13534dfab5962c212fce58b39d0b4648","unit_key":"form-001300F"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"0c06f3f3baf90424eaa2e60628d4453c5b40878a07833b921c7c2796a82bb091","unit_key":"form-001400F"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"e40dfc5e45e4154389a0b54aeaf861b765aa5db1abe74375e28006d402411c0d","unit_key":"form-001500F"}],"source_component_text_sha256":"e40dfc5e45e4154389a0b54aeaf861b765aa5db1abe74375e28006d402411c0d","source_law_id":"kr-006574-270243-ko","source_review_complete":true,"sou